WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.380 --> 01:39.020
[Episode 11]

01:39.020 --> 01:42.260
[Healing Hands]

01:48.430 --> 01:48.850
Miracle physician,

01:49.680 --> 01:50.130
you must have been hungry.

01:50.560 --> 01:51.130
I'll cook.

01:51.760 --> 01:52.130
Well...

01:56.710 --> 01:57.290
No need.

01:57.790 --> 01:58.410
I...

01:59.070 --> 01:59.740
I'm not hungry.

02:00.200 --> 02:01.570
You worked all day. How could you not be?

02:04.120 --> 02:04.810
Today,

02:04.840 --> 02:06.540
I even asked Miss Wang next door.

02:06.950 --> 02:08.260
Turns out the dish I made yesterday

02:08.360 --> 02:09.410
was missing one spice.

02:09.680 --> 02:10.690
Fix that will improve the taste.

02:11.520 --> 02:12.320
Su Muyu,

02:12.710 --> 02:13.750
you go out every day,

02:13.800 --> 02:14.700
walk around,

02:14.800 --> 02:15.760
pick up groceries,

02:15.910 --> 02:17.700
help me choose herbs,

02:17.700 --> 02:18.400
and decoct them.

02:18.560 --> 02:19.730
That's already a lot.

02:20.190 --> 02:21.690
You don't need to cook as well.

02:22.430 --> 02:24.060
You work harder every day.

02:24.470 --> 02:25.170
As for the chores,

02:25.360 --> 02:26.290
just leave them to me.

02:51.280 --> 02:51.980
Su Muyu.

02:53.960 --> 02:55.450
How can you

02:55.870 --> 02:56.540
master the sword...

03:00.840 --> 03:01.500
Because...

03:01.710 --> 03:02.450
...yet fail

03:03.030 --> 03:04.380
at cooking noodles?

03:06.360 --> 03:07.060
I'm not eating.

03:12.280 --> 03:12.890
Fine.

03:13.710 --> 03:15.600
It's your effort, after all.

03:19.310 --> 03:20.170
When I go out tomorrow,

03:20.310 --> 03:21.690
I'll buy flower cakes to make it up to you.

03:23.190 --> 03:24.130
And ask Miss Wang again...

03:26.030 --> 03:26.850
Su Muyu,

03:28.310 --> 03:28.730
can you

03:28.870 --> 03:30.340
promise me one thing?

03:30.960 --> 03:32.410
All right. What is it?

03:34.630 --> 03:35.220
Promise me

03:36.520 --> 03:38.100
to spare Miss Wang and spare me.

03:40.150 --> 03:41.010
Try a few more times,

03:41.590 --> 03:42.540
I'll get it right.

03:43.310 --> 03:44.380
Same with sword practice.

03:45.430 --> 03:45.940
As for this bowl of noodles,

03:47.520 --> 03:48.500
you'd better not eat it yet.

03:49.430 --> 03:49.940
Wait till tomorrow.

03:50.910 --> 03:51.940
Everyone in the martial world

03:52.030 --> 03:52.820
trains with a sword,

03:53.190 --> 03:54.730
yet only a few become Sword Deities.

03:55.710 --> 03:57.540
There are so many physicians,

03:58.000 --> 04:00.220
why am I the miracle physician?

04:02.150 --> 04:03.290
Because of talent.

04:03.630 --> 04:04.570
Everyone's born with different gifts.

04:08.000 --> 04:09.170
Su Muyu,

04:10.170 --> 04:11.040
some things

04:11.630 --> 04:12.570
can't be forced.

04:19.310 --> 04:20.780
When I first learned the sword,

04:21.240 --> 04:22.170
I was clumsy too.

04:25.120 --> 04:26.930
I can't talk you out of it, huh?

04:29.830 --> 04:30.580
What's that?

04:33.360 --> 04:34.850
They're chickens Mrs. Chen sent over.

04:35.480 --> 04:36.930
She knows I'm learning to cook from Miss Wang,

04:37.360 --> 04:38.340
so she sent them for practice.

04:41.070 --> 04:42.580
Since fate points the way,

04:43.270 --> 04:44.730
allow me to show a little skill.

04:52.950 --> 04:54.050
I learned this from my master,

04:54.290 --> 04:55.570
Herbal Chicken Stew.

04:55.680 --> 04:56.050
How is it?

04:57.190 --> 04:57.980
Smells amazing!

04:59.190 --> 05:00.730
It tastes even better.

05:05.270 --> 05:05.980
Go on, try.

05:06.750 --> 05:07.140
Okay.

05:22.000 --> 05:23.490
I didn't expect you to be such a good cook.

05:24.600 --> 05:25.370
These days,

05:25.950 --> 05:26.780
I've really made a fool of myself.

05:27.950 --> 05:29.290
You flatter me.

05:29.630 --> 05:30.100
I'm only good

05:30.430 --> 05:31.730
at this one dish.

05:32.720 --> 05:33.540
When I was little,

05:33.630 --> 05:34.540
my master taught it to me.

05:36.270 --> 05:38.140
But later, every time I made it,

05:38.720 --> 05:39.610
I'd think of him.

05:40.920 --> 05:43.100
And every time I did,

05:44.720 --> 05:45.730
I felt so sad,

05:47.560 --> 05:48.980
so I stopped making it.

05:53.360 --> 05:54.330
Never thought

05:54.390 --> 05:55.680
after all these years,

05:55.750 --> 05:56.590
my cooking

05:56.630 --> 05:57.860
would still be this good.

06:00.120 --> 06:01.170
Sorry about that, miracle physician.

06:04.040 --> 06:05.660
That was all when I was a kid.

06:06.190 --> 06:07.370
I'm grown now.

06:07.800 --> 06:09.930
I'm not hung up on something so small.

06:14.120 --> 06:15.020
Besides, death

06:15.800 --> 06:16.610
is just part of life.

06:18.390 --> 06:19.460
Even a miracle physician

06:20.630 --> 06:21.370
can't prevent it.

06:24.310 --> 06:25.780
While I was cooking just now,

06:26.600 --> 06:27.410
I realized

06:29.240 --> 06:30.460
I wasn't sad anymore.

06:31.270 --> 06:32.340
Thinking of him again,

06:33.600 --> 06:34.290
my heart

06:35.000 --> 06:35.730
felt warm.

06:49.480 --> 06:51.410
So this is the famous Flower Cake.

06:56.390 --> 06:57.330
It's delicious!

06:57.360 --> 06:58.100
Su Muyu,

06:58.160 --> 06:59.490
quick, have a piece!

07:08.060 --> 07:11.500
[Healing Hands]

07:13.510 --> 07:14.730
We've been waiting forever.

07:15.130 --> 07:15.780
It's been ages.

07:15.780 --> 07:16.760
Why isn't he out yet?

07:16.760 --> 07:18.430
The young master hasn't come out today?

07:19.360 --> 07:21.250
- He's out! - He's out!

07:22.630 --> 07:23.860
- He's out! - I'm instantly cured!

07:26.390 --> 07:27.270
You're pregnant.

07:27.360 --> 07:28.240
Pregnant...

07:28.310 --> 07:29.020
What?

07:29.870 --> 07:31.440
I'm not even married yet.

07:32.920 --> 07:33.910
Kidding.

07:34.310 --> 07:34.870
Your liver fire

07:34.920 --> 07:36.580
has been too high lately.

07:36.920 --> 07:38.050
Go line up over there.

07:38.050 --> 07:39.440
I'll have Mr. Su fetch you

07:39.630 --> 07:41.140
some flower tea

07:41.160 --> 07:41.940
to brew at home.

07:42.040 --> 07:42.370
Okay!

07:47.830 --> 07:48.220
See?

07:48.240 --> 07:49.860
- My back aches from standing. - You came on an empty stomach.

07:54.480 --> 07:55.570
The sign says:

07:55.830 --> 07:57.370
Thirty patients per day.

07:57.510 --> 07:58.780
Today's slots are full.

07:58.950 --> 07:59.740
If you want to see Mr. Su...

08:00.560 --> 08:01.620
to see the physician,

08:01.830 --> 08:02.980
please come earlier tomorrow.

08:05.190 --> 08:06.660
This white-robed gentleman

08:07.070 --> 08:08.780
looks quite handsome too!

08:09.720 --> 08:10.390
Yeah!

08:10.390 --> 08:11.420
He's a catch!

08:15.190 --> 08:16.220
Look at his brows and eyes...

08:16.270 --> 08:16.930
It's been a long time.

08:17.310 --> 08:17.810
Yeah.

08:17.870 --> 08:18.890
Thick brows, big eyes...

08:20.830 --> 08:21.540
Mr. Xie.

08:23.680 --> 08:24.300
Today...

08:24.360 --> 08:25.180
no more consults.

08:25.720 --> 08:27.490
Keep the tokens you got today.

08:27.720 --> 08:29.420
Come back tomorrow and queue in order.

08:29.480 --> 08:31.130
Why stop so early today?

08:32.080 --> 08:32.780
This fellow here

08:32.790 --> 08:33.930
came for a consult.

08:34.320 --> 08:36.020
He has a serious infection.

08:36.440 --> 08:37.500
If you don't leave now,

08:37.720 --> 08:38.420
you might catch it,

08:38.750 --> 08:39.540
and that would be bad.

08:39.910 --> 08:40.450
Oh...

08:40.720 --> 08:41.850
why didn't you say it earlier!

08:42.240 --> 08:43.090
Let's leave!

08:43.320 --> 08:44.550
- Move! - Go!

08:44.550 --> 08:45.610
She should've said so!

08:52.200 --> 08:54.570
This is the current dean of Shanqian Academy,

08:55.320 --> 08:56.020
Xie Xuan.

08:57.320 --> 08:58.140
The Scholar-Sword Deity!

09:00.000 --> 09:01.020
I came to this city to read

09:02.510 --> 09:03.570
and sensed

09:03.570 --> 09:04.570
there's a most unusual guest,

09:05.240 --> 09:06.210
[Xie Xuan, Scholar-Sword Deity]
so I paid a visit here.

09:07.840 --> 09:08.570
You're the one

09:08.670 --> 09:09.730
who never trained with a sword,

09:09.870 --> 09:10.850
yet the first time you drew,

09:10.910 --> 09:13.100
you looked every inch a Sword Deity,

09:13.100 --> 09:13.760
Xie Xuan?

09:15.870 --> 09:16.570
An honor at last!

09:17.000 --> 09:17.450
I'm Bai Hehuai,

09:17.840 --> 09:19.690
miracle physician of Medicine King Valley,

09:20.200 --> 09:21.780
senior to Xin Baicao.

09:22.270 --> 09:23.570
You're Mr. Xin's senior?

09:24.390 --> 09:24.930
Right.

09:25.200 --> 09:26.090
Fair and square!

09:27.320 --> 09:28.540
I'm of the same generation as Sikong Changfeng.

09:29.120 --> 09:30.330
He's half a disciple

09:30.330 --> 09:30.970
of Mr. Xin.

09:31.390 --> 09:33.210
So you're two ranks above me.

09:33.790 --> 09:35.060
I should call you grand-master.

09:36.390 --> 09:36.930
My apologies.

09:38.030 --> 09:38.810
Greetings, Physician Bai.

09:40.360 --> 09:40.850
So...

09:41.510 --> 09:42.660
I'm that remarkable?

09:45.360 --> 09:46.730
Didn't expect to meet you

09:46.730 --> 09:47.610
in Nan'an City.

09:48.790 --> 09:49.660
Did you visit here

09:50.480 --> 09:51.970
just to meet me?

09:53.320 --> 09:54.730
I wanted to know why you're in Nan'an City.

09:55.750 --> 09:56.730
It's not to kill.

09:59.000 --> 09:59.730
That's all I needed to know.

10:00.790 --> 10:01.610
Since we've met,

10:02.390 --> 10:03.610
why not stay for a meal?

10:10.150 --> 10:11.260
Nice to see you smile at last.

10:24.840 --> 10:25.380
Sir,

10:26.510 --> 10:27.020
enjoy your meal.

10:31.360 --> 10:31.810
Miss,

10:33.000 --> 10:34.300
try these fresh-baked flower cakes.

10:37.840 --> 10:38.850
You look new around here.

10:39.030 --> 10:40.210
Are you here to sightsee?

10:40.910 --> 10:41.380
No.

10:42.080 --> 10:42.690
I'm looking for someone.

10:43.670 --> 10:44.260
Oh, looking for someone?

10:46.320 --> 10:46.900
Enjoy your meal.

11:37.360 --> 11:38.330
They say, "I pick fresh every day;

11:38.670 --> 11:39.570
good cooking has its secrets."

11:40.440 --> 11:41.380
Cooking's like swordwork:

11:42.440 --> 11:43.140
miss one move,

11:43.510 --> 11:44.260
and nothing flows.

11:45.750 --> 11:46.570
What you make

11:46.910 --> 11:47.850
won't look good,

11:48.320 --> 11:48.900
smell good,

11:49.360 --> 11:50.020
or taste good.

11:59.550 --> 12:00.690
Smells amazing!

12:01.440 --> 12:03.140
Didn't expect you

12:03.200 --> 12:04.660
to be a kitchen deity too!

12:06.960 --> 12:07.690
I'm no kitchen deity.

12:08.630 --> 12:09.850
I just read many recipes,

12:10.270 --> 12:11.300
traveled many lands,

12:11.720 --> 12:12.690
and tasted many dishes,

12:13.270 --> 12:14.450
so I learned to cook plenty too.

12:15.510 --> 12:16.260
The way of cooking

12:16.870 --> 12:17.570
runs deep.

12:18.790 --> 12:19.730
I'd like to hear more.

12:21.960 --> 12:22.610
Su Muyu,

12:23.480 --> 12:24.060
Xie Xuan...

12:25.600 --> 12:26.500
You two changed careers?

12:27.910 --> 12:28.610
City Lord Li.

12:29.510 --> 12:30.140
City Lord?

12:40.360 --> 12:41.570
City Lord...

12:42.200 --> 12:42.900
This young lady

12:43.150 --> 12:44.480
is Xueyue City's Second City Lord,

12:44.720 --> 12:45.330
Li Hanyi,

12:46.480 --> 12:47.660
You're Sword Deity Xueyue?

12:48.440 --> 12:49.330
You must be

12:49.360 --> 12:50.570
the miracle physician

12:50.840 --> 12:52.380
who treated Blood River's Patriarch.

12:53.600 --> 12:54.850
Didn't expect you to be so young.

12:55.360 --> 12:56.260
And you're the one

12:56.360 --> 12:58.140
who created the Floral Sword Art,

12:58.360 --> 13:00.140
calling flowers with a single stroke,

13:00.140 --> 13:01.090
Sword Deity Xueyue?

13:02.030 --> 13:02.500
I am.

13:03.150 --> 13:04.180
And the sword in your hand

13:04.270 --> 13:05.660
is the one kept in Kunlun

13:05.870 --> 13:07.730
that can freeze the sunset with a single slash,

13:07.730 --> 13:09.020
the coldest sword under heaven,

13:09.030 --> 13:10.090
Froststeel?

13:10.790 --> 13:11.970
How good a sword is

13:12.440 --> 13:14.090
depends on who holds it.

13:18.080 --> 13:19.900
Why does this scene feel familiar?

13:22.390 --> 13:24.810
The legendary Floral Sword Art

13:25.320 --> 13:27.090
must be a stunning sight.

13:28.600 --> 13:30.610
Care to let me see it?

13:32.670 --> 13:33.330
Miracle physician,

13:34.000 --> 13:35.420
Sword Deities don't draw lightly.

13:36.120 --> 13:36.970
When they do,

13:37.600 --> 13:39.060
the city's swept in snow.

13:40.150 --> 13:40.690
True.

13:41.600 --> 13:42.850
I don't draw lightly.

13:43.720 --> 13:44.900
But meeting you...

13:47.600 --> 13:49.210
I might draw at any time.

14:00.960 --> 14:01.730
Aren't you two

14:02.150 --> 14:03.300
friends?

14:03.870 --> 14:04.970
We once fought side by side

14:05.000 --> 14:06.300
against the Demonic Sect's leader, Ye Dingzhi.

14:06.720 --> 14:07.420
But we're hardly friends.

14:08.120 --> 14:08.810
In the jianghu,

14:10.080 --> 14:11.020
no one wants

14:11.030 --> 14:11.970
to be Blood River's enemy,

14:12.840 --> 14:13.610
nor does anyone

14:14.120 --> 14:15.500
want to be Blood River's friend.

14:18.480 --> 14:19.780
City Lord Li and I

14:20.000 --> 14:20.900
are quite close.

14:23.480 --> 14:25.850
I'm senior to Xin Baicao of Medicine King Valley.

14:26.150 --> 14:27.300
Your Third City Lord,

14:27.320 --> 14:28.420
Sikong Changfeng,

14:29.670 --> 14:31.450
was once trained at the Medicine King Valley.

14:32.320 --> 14:35.420
He counts as half a disciple of Baicao.

14:36.120 --> 14:36.780
So,

14:37.080 --> 14:38.230
Sikong Changfeng

14:38.360 --> 14:39.610
should call me grand-master.

14:40.200 --> 14:41.730
You really put it to use.

14:45.510 --> 14:47.330
Didn't expect someone so young

14:48.000 --> 14:49.330
to be Medicine King's senior.

14:50.080 --> 14:50.930
The real deal!

14:52.120 --> 14:52.730
My apologies.

14:53.750 --> 14:54.610
Not at all.

14:55.000 --> 14:56.180
My rank's just too high,

14:56.630 --> 14:57.540
so everyone thinks

14:57.670 --> 14:58.810
I'm ancient.

15:01.240 --> 15:01.850
Truth is,

15:01.870 --> 15:02.600
my mother

15:02.600 --> 15:04.300
is the blood sister of Wen Luoyu,

15:04.600 --> 15:06.090
the Heir Consort of the Marquis of Zhenxi.

15:06.790 --> 15:07.970
Your First City Lord,

15:08.150 --> 15:09.260
Baili Dongjun,

15:09.670 --> 15:10.570
is my cousin!

15:10.870 --> 15:12.300
My senior is your cousin?

15:15.120 --> 15:16.210
We're family.

15:17.120 --> 15:17.660
Stay here

15:17.840 --> 15:18.610
and eat with us.

15:19.080 --> 15:19.500
Come!

15:35.270 --> 15:36.090
Smells great.

15:43.510 --> 15:45.260
You hold your liquor, miracle physician.

15:46.270 --> 15:47.210
Naturally, bottomless.

15:47.440 --> 15:48.260
And this wine

15:48.270 --> 15:48.930
is really good,

15:49.320 --> 15:50.500
with a hint of peach blossom,

15:50.840 --> 15:51.610
and a touch of sweetness.

15:55.030 --> 15:56.090
The peach note...

16:00.000 --> 16:01.570
A friend from Wangchengshan Sect left it

16:01.720 --> 16:02.970
after a consult.

16:03.150 --> 16:05.140
It was brewed by his junior, the sect leader.

16:05.440 --> 16:07.420
That junior's swordwork

16:07.510 --> 16:08.260
is now legendary

16:08.260 --> 16:10.380
across the jianghu nowadays.

16:10.960 --> 16:12.000
True,

16:12.000 --> 16:13.610
I haven't seen his swordplay.

16:14.240 --> 16:15.090
But his wine

16:15.240 --> 16:16.260
is indeed superb.

16:20.480 --> 16:21.140
How's the wine?

16:21.960 --> 16:22.570
Taste good?

16:25.670 --> 16:26.300
It's great.

16:29.510 --> 16:30.610
Miss Li,

16:30.870 --> 16:32.180
you're stunning,

16:32.670 --> 16:33.930
yet cold as frost.

16:35.150 --> 16:36.140
Nothing seems

16:36.140 --> 16:37.450
to move you.

16:38.120 --> 16:39.060
I thought

16:39.150 --> 16:40.500
you'd simply say "not bad,"

16:41.030 --> 16:43.090
didn't expect outright praise.

16:43.720 --> 16:44.720
Looks like this wine

16:44.720 --> 16:45.760
really is good.

16:47.270 --> 16:48.020
Dishes are all here.

16:49.840 --> 16:50.420
Let's eat.

16:50.500 --> 16:55.380
[Healing Hands]

17:02.720 --> 17:04.300
I know why you're here, Miss Li.

17:05.550 --> 17:06.130
Rest easy.

17:06.640 --> 17:08.130
Blood River has no agenda in Nan'an.

17:08.590 --> 17:10.220
But the miracle physician's place in Qiantang City

17:10.240 --> 17:10.890
was exposed,

17:11.680 --> 17:12.980
so she moved to Nan'an,

17:13.310 --> 17:13.850
As for me,

17:14.550 --> 17:15.700
I needed treatment,

17:16.000 --> 17:16.940
so I came along.

17:17.920 --> 17:19.650
That day in Jiuxiao City,

17:20.440 --> 17:21.020
I thought

17:21.590 --> 17:23.850
even if you couldn't disband Blood River,

17:24.880 --> 17:26.370
you'd be

17:27.200 --> 17:28.170
the new Patriarch.

17:30.200 --> 17:31.260
But in the end,

17:32.270 --> 17:34.460
Su Changhe became Patriarch,

17:35.160 --> 17:35.740
and you

17:36.720 --> 17:37.980
came to Nan'an,

17:38.270 --> 17:39.220
far from Blood River.

17:39.830 --> 17:41.300
That's not the ending

17:41.300 --> 17:42.330
Su Changhe promised me,

17:43.160 --> 17:45.740
and it's a very, very bad one.

17:49.720 --> 17:51.220
Your bias against Changhe

17:51.220 --> 17:52.300
still runs deep.

17:52.880 --> 17:53.610
Bias?

17:55.200 --> 17:56.330
Xie Xuan said

17:57.000 --> 17:58.220
your dear brother

17:58.920 --> 18:00.940
may not be the worst man alive,

18:01.590 --> 18:02.700
but he's surely

18:02.720 --> 18:04.170
the most annoying.

18:05.270 --> 18:06.130
His thick skin

18:06.590 --> 18:07.890
is rare in this world,

18:08.790 --> 18:09.940
a "classic" for the ages.

18:11.960 --> 18:13.780
A "classic" for the ages? Seriously?

18:16.310 --> 18:17.370
You're a bit drunk.

18:19.960 --> 18:21.330
Those were Xie Xuan's exact words.

18:22.240 --> 18:23.130
I only repeated them.

18:25.200 --> 18:26.610
Didn't expect Sword Deity Xueyue

18:26.790 --> 18:28.410
to speak ill behind someone's back.

18:29.680 --> 18:30.940
Worse,

18:31.720 --> 18:33.220
the other one badmouthing me

18:35.510 --> 18:36.610
seems to be here too.

18:51.200 --> 18:52.130
A brief spar

18:52.590 --> 18:53.740
is more than enough.

18:54.750 --> 18:55.740
We meet again.

18:56.310 --> 18:57.940
I should call you Patriarch now.

18:58.750 --> 18:59.980
You flatter me.

19:00.680 --> 19:01.850
Just call me Changhe,

19:02.550 --> 19:03.130
much friendlier.

19:03.790 --> 19:04.650
You deceived me.

19:05.750 --> 19:07.330
I've decided to kill you here.

19:09.790 --> 19:11.570
I never liked Changfeng's choice.

19:12.310 --> 19:13.540
An outfit like Blood River

19:14.160 --> 19:16.020
has no place in the jianghu.

19:17.750 --> 19:20.130
With Su Muyu as Patriarch, it could stand.

19:21.000 --> 19:22.810
If I took over, you'd tear it out by the roots?

19:24.310 --> 19:25.700
Looks like my reputation

19:25.720 --> 19:26.780
really is that bad.

19:28.750 --> 19:30.890
Your codename is your reputation:

19:31.750 --> 19:32.890
the Undertaker.

19:33.440 --> 19:34.850
Does the word

19:34.850 --> 19:35.810
sound lucky to you?

19:37.720 --> 19:38.510
The old Blood River

19:38.510 --> 19:39.810
might not have needed to exist,

19:40.480 --> 19:42.260
but we want to build a new Blood River.

19:43.000 --> 19:43.890
A new Blood River?

19:45.110 --> 19:46.260
One that doesn't live by killing,

19:47.030 --> 19:48.330
no longer in the shadows,

19:48.680 --> 19:50.740
yet walks beneath the jianghu.

19:52.270 --> 19:53.460
How do you plan to change?

19:53.920 --> 19:55.060
That's our affair.

19:57.350 --> 19:57.890
What,

19:58.590 --> 20:00.330
Xueyue City, the foremost city of the jianghu,

20:00.550 --> 20:01.410
has grown so overbearing

20:01.440 --> 20:02.170
it won't allow

20:02.170 --> 20:03.460
any other sects to exist?

20:04.240 --> 20:05.220
I couldn't be bothered to meddle,

20:05.960 --> 20:06.810
nor do I want to.

20:08.070 --> 20:09.300
I only promised Changfeng.

20:10.160 --> 20:10.610
Alright.

20:11.640 --> 20:13.330
Take it as your promise to me.

20:14.270 --> 20:15.300
If the Blood River to come

20:15.920 --> 20:17.020
is the same as before...

20:17.640 --> 20:18.300
Su Changhe,

20:19.310 --> 20:20.130
keep your head safe,

20:20.960 --> 20:21.700
and I'll come take it.

20:22.750 --> 20:23.570
What about Su Muyu's head?

20:24.440 --> 20:25.220
You won't take his?

20:25.960 --> 20:27.260
Why only mine?

20:30.960 --> 20:31.890
I'll take his too.

20:40.270 --> 20:41.980
Since you bookworm are here,

20:42.640 --> 20:43.780
no need for me to linger.

20:46.640 --> 20:48.220
Some person is an eyesore.

20:50.350 --> 20:51.460
I'll come fight you another time.

20:57.070 --> 20:58.460
Oh, she came to fight me?

20:59.310 --> 21:00.130
Then let's not meet again.

21:03.310 --> 21:04.060
What a fierce woman!

21:05.720 --> 21:06.940
I've heard Blood River's Umbrella Ghost

21:07.200 --> 21:09.130
and the Undertaker are close friends.

21:10.550 --> 21:11.780
I never quite understood it.

21:12.350 --> 21:13.330
You and he

21:13.680 --> 21:14.980
seem to walk different paths.

21:15.400 --> 21:16.330
But seeing you today,

21:16.680 --> 21:18.170
a passage came to mind,

21:18.830 --> 21:19.850
and I understand a little now.

21:20.830 --> 21:21.460
What passage?

21:22.680 --> 21:23.890
"Hearing snow outside the window,

21:24.550 --> 21:26.650
so near, yet so far."

21:28.110 --> 21:29.400
You mean the two of us

21:29.400 --> 21:30.610
are close in distance,

21:31.160 --> 21:32.780
yet worlds apart?

21:34.030 --> 21:34.500
No.

21:35.750 --> 21:37.330
The nearness and distance between you

21:37.750 --> 21:38.810
depend on a single thought.

21:41.310 --> 21:42.700
I hope your nearness this time

21:43.400 --> 21:44.260
lasts till the end.

21:48.440 --> 21:49.370
The meal's over.

21:49.830 --> 21:50.650
The wine's gone.

21:51.110 --> 21:52.650
She's said what needed saying.

21:53.310 --> 21:54.130
I should go too.

22:06.590 --> 22:07.260
Do you know why?

22:07.260 --> 22:08.330
Back then, several family heads

22:09.110 --> 22:10.570
ignored Blood River's rules,

22:10.830 --> 22:12.500
yet had to seize the Dormant Dragon Sword

22:12.500 --> 22:14.020
before daring to claim the Patriarch's title.

22:19.680 --> 22:21.330
There must be something odd about the sword.

22:22.350 --> 22:23.980
Something hidden in the hilt.

22:30.310 --> 22:31.460
Yellow Springs Pawnshop...

22:32.790 --> 22:34.300
The world's most secret bank,

22:34.350 --> 22:36.370
and the most secret assassin guild...

22:36.960 --> 22:38.540
What binds them?

22:42.550 --> 22:43.940
All I know is,

22:43.940 --> 22:44.950
the pawnshop keeps good things,

22:45.030 --> 22:46.330
very, very good things,

22:46.720 --> 22:48.130
worth a look.

22:53.110 --> 22:55.020
We'll lead Blood River to the other shore

22:55.070 --> 22:56.740
and erase its bloody reputation.

22:57.240 --> 22:58.410
Stop living by the kill,

22:59.000 --> 23:00.980
and found a sect in the light.

23:01.550 --> 23:03.500
And the most basic, most important thing...

23:05.310 --> 23:06.220
do you know what it is?

23:06.750 --> 23:07.220
What?

23:07.590 --> 23:08.940
Money, Su Muyu!

23:09.960 --> 23:11.260
All the years of Blood River's funds

23:11.260 --> 23:12.020
aren't at our base.

23:12.030 --> 23:12.700
Then where?

23:15.000 --> 23:16.260
Naturally, at Yellow Springs Pawnshop.

23:23.680 --> 23:24.500
Then let's move.

23:27.550 --> 23:29.130
Your days in Nan'an City

23:29.400 --> 23:30.700
end tonight.

23:32.550 --> 23:33.700
It was but a dream.

23:36.830 --> 23:37.850
Dreams end.

23:43.590 --> 23:45.330
I'll take the miracle physician

23:47.030 --> 23:47.810
back to her room.

23:48.550 --> 23:49.940
Sleeping here, she will catch a chill.

23:59.160 --> 23:59.850
Boo!

24:01.640 --> 24:03.170
So you were faking sleep.

24:03.400 --> 24:04.780
I... I was asleep,

24:05.750 --> 24:06.980
but something

24:06.980 --> 24:08.090
reeking

24:08.110 --> 24:08.890
walked in,

24:09.030 --> 24:10.220
and the stench woke me.

24:16.720 --> 24:17.300
Miracle physician,

24:18.240 --> 24:18.980
I have to go.

24:20.700 --> 24:27.980
♪Blades have stained my youth...♪

24:29.510 --> 24:30.330
Go on, go.

24:31.200 --> 24:33.170
You've always had unfinished business.

24:33.550 --> 24:34.330
This day

24:34.510 --> 24:35.540
was bound to come.

24:40.110 --> 24:40.850
But this place

24:41.070 --> 24:42.130
is no dream.

24:42.880 --> 24:44.260
It's your journey's end.

24:47.270 --> 24:48.300
When you return in triumph,

24:48.720 --> 24:49.460
this medicine shop

24:49.880 --> 24:50.780
will still be here for you.

24:51.510 --> 24:52.540
And all the pretty girls

24:52.920 --> 24:54.460
in Nan'an City

24:55.680 --> 24:56.700
will be here for you too.

25:00.590 --> 25:01.330
Much obliged.

25:05.030 --> 25:06.060
Come back soon...

25:09.070 --> 25:10.570
and make me a proper bowl

25:11.200 --> 25:11.850
of noodles.

25:14.070 --> 25:14.610
All right.

25:18.820 --> 25:23.540
♪I'm lucky to meet you♪

25:39.200 --> 25:40.370
Reapers clear the way

25:41.070 --> 25:42.700
as we reach Yellow Springs.

25:42.830 --> 25:44.130
We've reached Yellow Springs,

25:44.790 --> 25:46.130
so where are the Reapers?

25:49.590 --> 25:50.650
Paper umbrellas ward off the yang energy.

25:52.030 --> 25:53.160
The Yellow Springs reapers

25:53.160 --> 25:54.460
do carry a chill,

25:54.720 --> 25:56.300
creepier than Blood River.

25:57.200 --> 25:58.170
Our Master sent us

25:58.200 --> 25:59.860
to wait here a long time,

26:00.000 --> 26:01.560
Patriarch of Blood River.

26:01.590 --> 26:02.850
We've heard your Master

26:02.850 --> 26:03.810
is most capable.

26:04.270 --> 26:05.300
He even foresaw

26:05.300 --> 26:06.090
we'd come here.

26:06.750 --> 26:08.220
Then please, Sir,

26:08.680 --> 26:09.980
and Master Su Muyu,

26:10.640 --> 26:11.460
board the boat.

26:44.920 --> 26:47.300
You must be the current Su family head,

26:47.310 --> 26:48.500
Su Muyu?

26:49.750 --> 26:50.780
Young master,

26:51.880 --> 26:53.170
you're quite handsome.

26:55.160 --> 26:56.850
Why so cold, young master?

26:57.310 --> 26:58.370
Is it because

26:58.400 --> 27:00.130
we're not acquainted?

27:06.640 --> 27:08.650
Will you talk to me now?

27:12.070 --> 27:13.850
All right, I'll stop teasing you.

27:14.350 --> 27:15.260
You can change faces, Miss?

27:15.920 --> 27:17.980
You sure I'm a "girl"?

27:18.550 --> 27:20.090
Now I'm really confused.

27:23.310 --> 27:24.220
What's your name?

27:25.240 --> 27:26.220
They call me

27:26.590 --> 27:27.810
Hongying.

27:27.810 --> 27:28.980
[Hongying]

27:36.270 --> 27:37.130
Unbelievable.

27:38.030 --> 27:39.330
The Mu family can disguise too,

27:40.200 --> 27:41.570
but compared to Hongying,

27:42.590 --> 27:44.020
they're far behind.

28:57.830 --> 28:59.220
We're the Umbrella Ghost

28:59.270 --> 29:00.330
and the Undertaker.

29:00.880 --> 29:02.610
Putting on spooks before us?

29:03.590 --> 29:04.570
That's rich.

29:05.590 --> 29:06.170
Let's go in.

29:26.680 --> 29:27.640
You're the master

29:27.680 --> 29:28.940
of Yellow Springs Pawnshop?

29:29.000 --> 29:30.060
Wait!

29:45.180 --> 29:49.620
[Shopkeeper Wang of Yellow Springs Pawnshop]

29:53.960 --> 29:54.700
I can't balance the books.

29:54.880 --> 29:55.980
Forget it!

29:56.070 --> 29:57.650
Kill them all!

29:58.920 --> 30:00.410
Master,

30:00.790 --> 30:02.060
are you serious?

30:02.440 --> 30:03.220
Kill them!

30:03.480 --> 30:04.170
End it once and for all.

30:04.270 --> 30:05.220
We won't even own up!

30:05.920 --> 30:06.700
As you command.

30:15.460 --> 30:18.940
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

30:18.980 --> 30:22.860
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

30:24.700 --> 30:28.180
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

30:28.220 --> 30:32.060
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

30:34.060 --> 30:37.340
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

30:37.460 --> 30:39.540
♪Still I can't let go♪

30:39.700 --> 30:43.140
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

30:43.620 --> 30:45.820
♪My heart no longer my own♪

30:45.940 --> 30:50.940
♪No one can escape from love♪

31:07.540 --> 31:11.260
♪How many hidden feelings♪

31:11.380 --> 31:15.460
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

31:16.700 --> 31:20.580
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

31:20.700 --> 31:24.940
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

31:26.060 --> 31:28.940
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

31:29.020 --> 31:33.260
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

31:35.540 --> 31:39.540
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

31:39.580 --> 31:43.020
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

31:44.540 --> 31:47.980
